      "summary": "Tests proving http-declarative-observation-source.adapter.ts's own resolveAssembledRequest degrades both typed connector-assembly failures to an unavailable evidence outcome naming the failing class, that every other concurrently-collected concept settles unaffected, and that test-connector.controller.ts's own two direct resolveConnectorRequest calls still propagate either failure uncaught.",
      "task": "task/connector-configuration-and-placeholder-contract/degrade-unresolved-connector-call-to-unavailable"
