      "title": "Proof for refusing register-connector when a placeholder escapes every capability's properties",
      "summary": "Tests proving that registerConnector refuses a connector-configuration registration or edit embedding an orphaned Subject-attribute placeholder, names it with the failing capabilities, exempts requester/credential placeholders, succeeds once any capability declares the attribute, and holds edits to the same refusal — all traced to the HTTP 422 envelope.",
      "task": "task/connector-configuration-and-placeholder-contract/refuse-connector-registration-with-orphaned-placeholder"
    },
